                    \\\
                    \&amp; \simeq
                    im(f'|_{F^p \pi_{p+q} X})
                    \\\
                    \&amp; \simeq
                    F^p \pi_{p+q}X/ker(f')
                    \\\
                    \&amp; \simeq
                    F^p \pi_{p+q} X/F^{p-1} \pi_{p+q}X
